cf-ancestry-human = Human
cf-ancestry-human-description = Humans are a varied people, and their talent is adaptability.
cf-ancestry-dwarf = Dwarf
cf-ancestry-dwarf-description = Dwarves are stout and stubborn, shaped by stone and long memory.
cf-ancestry-goblin = Goblin
cf-ancestry-goblin-description = Goblins are small, quick, and impossible to ignore.
cf-ancestry-elf = Elf
cf-ancestry-elf-description = Elves are quick and keen-eyed, with a long memory for magic and craft.
cf-ancestry-gnome = Gnome
cf-ancestry-gnome-description = Gnomes are small, hardy, and endlessly curious.
cf-ancestry-halfling = Halfling
cf-ancestry-halfling-description = Halflings are small, sharp-eyed, and hard to pin down.
cf-ancestry-leshy = Leshy
cf-ancestry-leshy-description = Leshies are nature spirits given small bodies of living plants.
cf-ancestry-orc = Orc
cf-ancestry-orc-description = Orcs are strong and enduring, and they choose where that strength goes.
cf-ancestry-catfolk = Catfolk
cf-ancestry-catfolk-description = Catfolk are quick and expressive, and they trust their ears as much as their eyes.
cf-ancestry-hobgoblin = Hobgoblin
cf-ancestry-hobgoblin-description = Hobgoblins are tall and disciplined, built to keep a formation together.
cf-ancestry-kholo = Kholo
cf-ancestry-kholo-description = Kholos are strong and sharp-minded, and they remember their dead.
cf-ancestry-kobold = Kobold
cf-ancestry-kobold-description = Kobolds are small, quick-tongued crafters who see well in the dark.
cf-ancestry-lizardfolk = Lizardfolk
cf-ancestry-lizardfolk-description = Lizardfolk are patient hunters with claws and a long memory.
cf-ancestry-ratfolk = Ratfolk
cf-ancestry-ratfolk-description = Ratfolk are small, clever, and used to working shoulder to shoulder.
cf-ancestry-tengu = Tengu
cf-ancestry-tengu-description = Tengu are light on their feet and rarely without a sharp answer or a sharp beak.
cf-ancestry-tripkee = Tripkee
cf-ancestry-tripkee-description = Tripkees are small, watchful climbers who know the wetlands.
cf-ancestry-azarketi = Azarketi
cf-ancestry-azarketi-description = Azarketi are amphibious people of the sea, quicker in the water than on land.
cf-ancestry-android = Android
cf-ancestry-android-description = Androids are synthetic people with living souls, quick of hand and mind.
cf-ancestry-fetchling = Fetchling
cf-ancestry-fetchling-description = Fetchlings are people of the shadow, at home where the light runs out.
cf-ancestry-fleshwarp = Fleshwarp
cf-ancestry-fleshwarp-description = Fleshwarps are people reshaped by magic, and no two of them look alike.
cf-ancestry-kitsune = Kitsune
cf-ancestry-kitsune-description = Kitsune are fox-featured people who can wear another face.
cf-ancestry-sprite = Sprite
cf-ancestry-sprite-description = Sprites are tiny fey, quick, curious, and touched by magic.
cf-ancestry-strix = Strix
cf-ancestry-strix-description = Strix are winged people, loyal to their own and light on their feet.

