cf-class-alchemist = Alchemist
cf-class-description-alchemist = A scholar who prepares alchemical items and uses them to solve fights.
cf-class-animist = Animist
cf-class-description-animist = A divine caster who prepares a few spells and calls on apparitions.
cf-class-barbarian = Barbarian
cf-class-description-barbarian = A fierce warrior who turns rage into raw physical power.
cf-class-bard = Bard
cf-class-description-bard = A performer whose magic comes from art, wit, and inspiration.
cf-class-champion = Champion
cf-class-description-champion = An armored divine warrior who defends a cause. Dexterity is the key ability for now. Strength is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-cleric = Cleric
cf-class-description-cleric = A divine caster who prepares spells in service of a deity. The deity's favored weapon is trained once deities are added.
cf-class-commander = Commander
cf-class-description-commander = A leader who directs allies with tactics and a banner.
cf-class-druid = Druid
cf-class-description-druid = A primal caster tied to a druidic order and the wild.
cf-class-exemplar = Exemplar
cf-class-description-exemplar = A hero who channels divine sparks through personal ikons. Dexterity is the key ability for now. Strength is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-fighter = Fighter
cf-class-description-fighter = A weapon specialist trained in armor and a wide set of arms. Strength is the key ability for now. Dexterity is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-guardian = Guardian
cf-class-description-guardian = A heavily armored defender who holds the line for allies.
cf-class-gunslinger = Gunslinger
cf-class-description-gunslinger = A firearm specialist whose way defines how they shoot.
cf-class-inventor = Inventor
cf-class-description-inventor = An engineer who builds a signature innovation and pushes it past its limits.
cf-class-investigator = Investigator
cf-class-description-investigator = A detective who plans a stratagem before they strike.
cf-class-magus = Magus
cf-class-description-magus = A warrior who blends weapon strikes with prepared arcane spells. Dexterity is the key ability for now. Strength is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-monk = Monk
cf-class-description-monk = An unarmored combatant who fights with precise unarmed strikes. Dexterity is the key ability for now. Strength is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-necromancer = Necromancer
cf-class-description-necromancer = An occult caster who prepares spells drawn from death and the grave.
cf-class-oracle = Oracle
cf-class-description-oracle = A spontaneous divine caster marked by a mystery and a curse.
cf-class-psychic = Psychic
cf-class-description-psychic = A spontaneous occult caster who draws magic from the mind. Intelligence is the key ability for now. Charisma is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-ranger = Ranger
cf-class-description-ranger = A hunter who tracks prey and fights in the wild. Dexterity is the key ability for now. Strength is also valid, and that choice will be implemented later.
cf-class-rogue = Rogue
cf-class-description-rogue = A skilled skirmisher who strikes when a foe is off-guard.
cf-class-runesmith = Runesmith
cf-class-description-runesmith = A crafter who etches runes onto gear and weapons.
cf-class-sorcerer = Sorcerer
cf-class-description-sorcerer = A spontaneous caster whose bloodline supplies their magic. Arcane is used until the bloodline's tradition is implemented.
cf-class-summoner = Summoner
cf-class-description-summoner = A caster who fights beside a linked eidolon. Occult is used until the eidolon's tradition is implemented.
cf-class-swashbuckler = Swashbuckler
cf-class-description-swashbuckler = A daring skirmisher who fights with style and finishing moves.
cf-class-thaumaturge = Thaumaturge
cf-class-description-thaumaturge = A scholar who exploits a creature's weakness with esoterica.
cf-class-witch = Witch
cf-class-description-witch = A prepared caster whose patron grants their spells. Occult is used until the patron's tradition is implemented.
cf-class-wizard = Wizard
cf-class-description-wizard = A scholar who prepares arcane spells from a spellbook. The arcane school's extra spell and cantrip will be implemented later.
cf-background-acolyte = Acolyte
cf-background-description-acolyte = You spent your early years in the service of a deity or philosophy.
cf-ancestry-CF-Goblin-description = Small, quick, and curious, goblins thrive on noise, scraps, and trouble.

